{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-16T14:42:01.458Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"732899a8c3306ebf8248e146","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-slack-i7ug"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Install the pinned release npm into a job-local prefix"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The release workflow replaces the runner's global npm with the pinned npm. Parallel jobs on one runner host share the toolcache Node installation, so one job's global install mutates a sibling job's npm mid-install (ENOTEMPTY, or npm: command not found), as reported by unbraind/pm-ops#284 for the fleet."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-16T14:42:01.458Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-16T14:42:01.458Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-glm"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The release workflow installs the pinned npm with --prefix into a job-local directory and prepends that prefix bin to the job path; The workflow keeps the exact-version assertion on the effective npm; A workflow-contract test fails if any workflow replaces the global npm"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"1d0242f9e50f6cba6c563e3e4c41776be23004fbe26ce7d91cfb375ea844520c","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0d3b8f23b3450791398bff71fc8198f22e2288cfed001f88b2921f